Package: org.legacyshazam.smoke
Name: ShazamX
Version: 0.3.7
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Restores song recognition in Shazam 5.5.1 on iOS 6.
 .
 Install Shazam 5.5.1 before installing this tweak.
 .
 Turn the tweak on or off in Settings > ShazamX.
 .
 Tested on iPhone 4S running iOS 6.1.3. Other iOS 6 devices may work.
Maintainer: mrnik12
Author: mrnik12
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
